# [FAIRNESS-C 2026-05-29] GitHub-safe ignore: keep code/reports/configs/plots,
# exclude large audio data, feature pickles, and model weights (GitHub caps 100MB/file).

# --- Raw & processed audio datasets (tens of GB) ---
Dataset_Ori/
Processed_Balanced19/
Processed_Balanced19_v2/
Processed_Balanced19_v3/
Processed_Balanced19_v4_merged/
